<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Leon - 140,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Ensted prompt $6.80 fio scale load/35,000 shinc Elsam.</p>
<p>TBN - 55,000 tonnes coal Roberts Bank/Taranto Jan 413.60 fio five days shinc Ilva.</p>
<p>There were no ore fixtures reported on Friday.</p>
</text>
